It's not a second wiki. It's a fork of the old wiki after wikia
started cluttering up the screen with commercials, degrading the
usability and formally restricting the looks of the wiki.

You can read about the reasons to move on
http://nethackwiki.com/wiki/NetHackWiki:Community_Portal/Archive4#New_.22Wikia.22_aka_.22Oasis.22_skin:_Problems.2C_legal_restrictions.2C_and_tweaks

If you look at the recent changes of both wikis (though good luck
finding it on the wikia site!) you'll see that nethack.wikia mostly
gets IP editing and often vandalizing isn't reverted. AFAIK all admins
moved over the http://nethackwiki.com/ 

